getty-bun.ps1 calls .NET types directly ([System.IO.File], System.Diagnostics.Process, HttpWebRequest, Add-Type at install). Under Constrained Language Mode (AppLocker/WDAC script enforcement) most of that is refused, so the starter probably cannot run at all, not just fall back to windows-x64-baseline. The README labels this not checked. CI runners run FullLanguage. Either fail with one clear getty-bun line when $ExecutionContext.SessionState.LanguageMode is not FullLanguage, or document the requirement. The real check needs a WDAC-enforced host: a card on the windows-developer board through the hub.
